# A forwarder the sender never listed: SPF fails, the untouched DKIM signature still passes and aligns, DMARC passes.
client-ip: 198.51.100.9
helo: fwd.forwarder.example
mail-from: alice@example.com
authserv-id: mx.receiver.example
[zone]
example.com TXT v=spf1 ip4:192.0.2.3 -all
_dmarc.example.com TXT v=DMARC1; p=reject
[message]
From: Alice <alice@example.com>
To: Bob <bob@receiver.example>
Subject: Fixture
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Message-ID: <fx1@example.com>

Hello Bob.
[sign domain=example.com selector=s1]
[expect]
mx.receiver.example; spf=fail smtp.mailfrom=alice@example.com; dkim=pass (2048-bit key) header.d=example.com header.s=s1 header.b=vbyOuf58; dmarc=pass (p=REJECT sp=REJECT dis=NONE) header.from=example.com
